{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_1_level_main_01-01_end","groupId":"main_1","stageId":"main_01-01","title":"孤岛","storyCode":"1-1","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-01_end.txt","sourceHash":"0a7cb3b2d386c736a9f096080828e331a892e43693be771eacb268c131673814","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"博士一行途经一家名为阿撒兹勒的诊所。\n曾几何时的交流与如今人去楼空的荒凉，勾起了阿米娅对于感染者处境的一些想法。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第七关（后）\n时间未知 \\ 天气未知 \\ 能见度 低\n切尔诺伯格 行动组E0所在地\nDr.{@nickname}营救行动 第三阶段"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"这个诊所......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，是不是以前我们来过那个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......确实是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只是怎么......已经变成了，这个样子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"已经人去楼空了......看来，是遭到了整合运动的袭击吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"这难道就是那个感染者诊所，阿撒兹勒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"明明掌握着整个切尔诺伯格的地下情报网，却不肯和我们合作......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"那时，他们和整合运动之间的关系也十分模棱两可......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，如果他们当时肯向我们分享情报，或者仅仅是给个提示......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"我们也许就早点能离开这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"这种下场，是他们自作自受！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"也不全是这样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，当时和他们交涉时你也在场吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"他们那傲慢冷漠的态度，我真是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"不能怪罪他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"头儿......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_0_ori"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感染者本就很难相信别人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"经历过那么多苦难，当然会变得保守与顽固。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"至少他们那样做......我能理解，也愿意原谅他们。不提防他人，就会被他人伤害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"何况，就连感染者之间，也是没法轻易互相信任的。而且并不是每个人都愿意像我们一样冒险......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"感染者诊所？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......他们是一家只医治感染者的黑市诊所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"鉴于感染者的社会地位，大家是不可能在街道上抛头露面的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"有些不愿被抛进隔离区的感染者，依然也会在城市里，小心翼翼地掩藏自己的身姿，苟活着......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"阿撒兹勒，就是向这些感染者提供服务的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......它们，一定是拒绝了整合运动的合作要求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我之前和你说过，我们得了病吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......这种病，不仅会杀死我们，也会让我们拥有不同于常人的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不用法杖，就能释放源石技艺哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，这种病，不止在生理上，会消磨我们的生命......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"它也会让我们再也不能像正常人一样生活。正常人的社会，会剥去你的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这座切尔诺伯格城，已经是所有规则的象征了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"驱逐感染者，消灭感染者，鄙夷感染者，恐惧感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"最后，落到如此下场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，又有多少感染者，会有机会，选择整合运动，甚至是其他的感染者组织，或者罗德岛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"大多数感染者，不过是失去了所有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这个诊所，大概，也曾经是最后那么几个感染者，温暖的家吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"矿石病是无药可医的。至少此时此刻，感染者只能在绝望中......痛苦地失去生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"而后他们的遗体......也会成为新的传染源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不同于常人的特殊力量，染上之后就必然会死去的可怕传染病——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者......被这片大地上的多数人所恐惧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"光是这么两三句话，博士大概也没法切身体会吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但当你面对这些问题导致的后果时......你会明白的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你会明白，感染者的处境，究竟有多现实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"像罗德岛这样不分彼此，或是整合运动那样狂热的排外拥内的感染者组织，都很少见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"我能理解你的怒气，但我也能理解那个小诊所的苦衷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"可能，他们是真的碰上了什么问题吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"至少现在，我们的怨气，都该和这个诊所的曾经一样，化作粉尘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛的各位都是好人。也许会有很多人因畏惧与敌意，相互间产生了种种隔阂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但只要在罗德岛，大家一定能解开误会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"阿撒兹勒......罗德岛，又何尝不是一个阿撒兹勒呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿米娅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们走吧，博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["近卫干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["医疗干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜宾"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["临光"]}]}
